        "name": "USN-8430-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that ADSys did not properly handle certain HTTP/2 frames. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 26.04 LTS. (CVE-2026-27141)  It was discovered that ADSys did not properly handle certain HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-33814)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-27141",
          "CVE-2026-33814"
        ]
      },
